Z||000003||rogergarrison||04-08-2001||12:10 AM||||there all just getting greedy. they make tons of money with there ads, selling you items with your OWN PICS. Anyone know of a photo site thats webtv friendly? thats why I started photopoint in the first place.||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||04-08-2001||03:18 PM||||It may be annoying but If you follow what's going on in the industry,,, ad revenue is not paying the bills like it once did. One company after another using that model has had to either charge for service, serverely reduce service, or close entirely. Net Zero for example is now free only for the 1st 40 hours every month. As I reported in another thread Juno now forces free users to install special software so Juno can process data for who ever they see fit. Users have no say in what the machine is being used for by Juno.<P>With the current situation in the venture capitol and stock market this is going to continue to happen for the forseeable future.<P>As server and bandwidth required to run "free" services has grown ad revenue dried up. Keep in mind a typical server costs several thousand dollars just for the server. then add all the stuff that goes with it. Just the floor space that a single server rack sits on costs on average about $900 a year to lease. Figure that most server farms fill quite large rooms.... And all this is before you add personel costs and everything else. <p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 04-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||rogergarrison||04-08-2001||08:18 PM||||I can deal with that. But the main thing that gets me mad, is those places now want to charge for the services that now totally suck. Other ones that come to mind now is how bad geocities is, and yahoo. I used to like chatting there but now your lucky if you can even get on a couple times a week-and even then you get blank pages and booted every little while. Photopoint used to work great with my webtv, I could load up pics as fast as I could type. Now my web disconnects just waiting for the login to come up. I have to put pics in usually at 2am so I dont have to spend hours-now they want me to pay them !!!! dont think so. I wouldnt mind paying if it worked way it was supposed to, money isnt the point.||||reg||1
